<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">Perfect<sp/>hash<sp/>functions<sp/>may<sp/>be<sp/>used<sp/>for<sp/>memory<sp/>efficient<sp/>storage<sp/>and</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">fast<sp/>retrieval<sp/>of<sp/>items<sp/>from<sp/>static<sp/>sets,<sp/>among<sp/>other<sp/>uses.<sp/></highlight></codeline>
