<codeline><highlight class="normal">We<sp/>denote<sp/>them<sp/>respectively<sp/>by<sp/>`phf`<sp/>and<sp/>`phf_lvl2`.</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">For<sp/>small<sp/>sets,<sp/>`phf`<sp/>is<sp/>more<sp/>memory<sp/>efficient<sp/>and<sp/>provides<sp/>faster<sp/>queries.</highlight></codeline>
